  "notes": "{虚脱|きょだつ} describes a profound state of depletion, both physical and psychological.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {虚脱|きょだつ}⟦{状態|じょうたい}→状態：03345_joutai⟧: state of prostration\n- ⟦{虚脱感|きょだつかん}→虚脱感：15994_kyodatsukan⟧: feeling of exhaustion\n- {虚脱|きょだつ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to become prostrate\n\nMEDICAL CONTEXT:\nIn medical terminology, {虚脱|きょだつ} can refer to circulatory collapse or shock.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{疲労|ひろう}→疲労：13603_hirou⟧: fatigue (more general)\n- ⟦{脱力|だつりょく}→脱力：10659_datsuryoku⟧: loss of strength\n- ⟦ぐったり→ぐったり：05835_guttari⟧: exhausted, limp (onomatopoeia)",
